<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύμφων-ος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξ-,</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not harmonious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				402d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>discordant, at variance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					482c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ocell.
					4.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀλλήλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					28.25
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.Prooem.</u>
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					860c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς αὐτοῖς</span> Arg.Str.I.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not speaking the same language,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἄλληλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					262d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				777d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ταῖς διαλέκτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.53
				</span></i>
			.</div>
